OL,3,GNEWSAThe taxidermy museum that put a
OL,4,Avillage on the map
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor more than a century, visitors
OL,7,Ftravelled to a quiet Sussex village to
OL,8,Fsee one of Britain's strangest
OL,9,Fattractions.
OL,11,FA museum in Bramber displayed hundreds
OL,12,Fof stuffed animals arranged in
OL,13,Felaborate scenes, from kitten weddings
OL,14,Fand rabbit schoolrooms to birds
OL,15,Frecreating nursery rhymes.
OL,17,FThe attraction was created by Walter
OL,18,FPotter, who spent his life building
OL,19,Fdisplays that became famous throughout
OL,20,FBritain.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
