OL,3,GNEWSAThe taxidermy museum that put a
OL,4,Avillage on the map
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to Secret Sussex, Andrew
OL,7,FWoodfield, from Steyning Museum, said
OL,8,FPotter was born in Bramber in 1835 and
OL,9,Fbegan displaying his work at his
OL,10,Ffather's inn before opening a dedicated
OL,11,Fmuseum that attracted visitors from
OL,12,Facross the country.
